SUMMARY:Deadline: Hillman Prizes 2027 for Journalism (incl. Broadcast and D
 ocumentary)
DESCRIPTION:The Hillman Prizes honour journalism in service of the common g
 ood\, with priority for work with US impact. Five categories: Book (nonfic
 tion)\; Newspaper Journalism (story\, series or multimedia\, print or onli
 ne)\; Magazine Journalism (longform)\; Broadcast Journalism (local news\, 
 television\, documentary\, radio or podcast\, at least 20 minutes total pa
 ckage length)\; and Opinion and Analysis (any...\n\nOrganisation: The Sidn
 ey Hillman Foundation\nLocation: Open to journalists globally\; work must 
 have been widely accessible to a US audience. Ceremony in New York City\, 
 May 2027.\nAward: USD 5\,000 honorarium and a certificate for each Hillman
  Prize winner. No entry fee.\n\nMore: https://www.hillmanfoundation.org/hi
 llman-prizes/nominations?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
